        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Some critics of style tell us to avoid the passive everywhere because it adds words and often deletes the character or agent, the “doer” of the action. But the passive is sometimes the better choice. To choose between active and passive, you have to answer three questions:",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                152,
                785,
                254
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    152.0
                ],
                [
                    785.0,
                    152.0
                ],
                [
                    785.0,
                    254.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    254.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Must your readers know who is responsible for the action? Often, we don't say who does an action because we don't know or readers won't care. We naturally choose the passive in these sentences:",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                272,
                784,
                348
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    272.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    272.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    348.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    348.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "✓ The president was rumored to have considered resigning.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                353,
                567,
                376
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
