        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We must decide whether to improve education in the sciences alone or to raise the level of education across the whole curriculum.  $ \\underline{\\text{The weight given to industrial competitiveness as opposed to the value we attach to the liberal arts}} $ newinformation will determine activeverb our decision. familiar information",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
